      value: Uhh alright, this place is safe
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4930517055831265834, guid: 0d82ddcb517decf4c914d4f289440bbd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messages.Array.data[1]'
      value: Jeff is on the stage probably...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4930517055831265834, guid: 0d82ddcb517decf4c914d4f289440bbd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messages.Array.data[2]'
      value: Alright, listen here, if you want to get out
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4930517055831265834, guid: 0d82ddcb517decf4c914d4f289440bbd, type: 3}
